seeks come next → the item here closes (citing the cell it fed) or respawns sharper; each turn changes the board the next turn reads from. Items here are leads until graded and gated by Logan; a gated finding is marked FINDING and proposed to REGISTRATION (it is not canon until Logan inscribes it there).","related":["LOGIC-PUZZLE-REGISTRATION","LOGIC-PUZZLE-ROSTER","SESSION-1-SNAPSAVE","CHARACTER-SHEET","SESSION-0-CHECKPOINT"],"tags":["#2/","#3/"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[69,76]]},